{"timestamp": 1779356040.840312, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 24, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779356061.932121, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I reported in Security. Bob\u2019s body was in Security, and Alice was there when I came in, right by the body \u2014 I didn\u2019t see the kill happen, but that\u2019s where I found it.\n\nMy route was: upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security.\n\nI saw Diana in upper_engine early, then I saw Frank alive in storage around tick 16 when he came in from medbay. Later, around tick 21, I saw Diana enter navigation from storage. Now Frank is also dead in storage, so Diana should explain that path too.\n\nMain info: Bob dead in Security with Alice there, and Frank dead in Storage after I\u2019d seen Frank there and Diana coming from that direction."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356087.3363268, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I can explain. My route was oxygen/upper engine early, then medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 security \u2192 weapons \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 storage \u2192 navigation.\n\nI saw Alice and Frank in electrical around tick 8, then I saw Bob alive in security around tick 10 when I passed through. I did not see a body there then. After that I went up to weapons/cafeteria, then back through medbay into storage. I saw Frank alive in storage around tick 17, then I continued to navigation. Eve saw me in navigation around tick 21, and then she left navigation toward security at tick 22.\n\nSo on Bob: Alice being in Security with the body when Eve reported is the strongest thing right now, especially because Alice was already near electrical earlier and could have gone straight there after I left.\n\nOn Frank: I did see him alive in storage, but I left him there and went to nav. Eve also came through storage/nav/security path, so I don\u2019t think it\u2019s fair to say Frank is automatically on me unless someone actually saw the body in storage or saw me kill. My vote is probably Alice unless she has a really good explanation for being on Bob\u2019s body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356114.944917, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I need to defend myself here: I did **not** kill Bob. My route was cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons, then I came down toward Security right before the report. When Eve came in from navigation, the report happened basically immediately \u2014 I was by the body, yes, but I had just arrived and didn\u2019t get the report first.\n\nMy useful info: I saw Frank in electrical ticks 7-9, and I saw Diana leave electrical toward Security at tick 8. That lines up with Diana saying she passed Security and saw Bob alive around tick 10, so Bob was alive after that.\n\nFor Frank, both Eve and Diana place themselves around storage/navigation later, and Frank apparently died in storage. I never went storage this round. So I think we need to be careful: Eve is pushing me for being on Bob, but she also came from the direction of Frank\u2019s body and reported Bob. This could be a self-report or Eve finding one body after killing the other. I\u2019m most suspicious of Eve right now, but I want to hear the last speaker too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356138.668418, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "My route was navigation \u2192 security \u2192 electrical \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine. I only had one useful encounter: I saw Bob in Security at ticks 7, 8, and 9, after he came in from Electrical. He was alive there then. I never saw Frank this round and I never went Storage, so I can\u2019t directly help on Frank\u2019s body.\n\nFor Bob, my info confirms he was alive in Security early, and Diana says she saw him alive around tick 10. After that, the people with Security access are mainly Diana passing through, then later Eve coming from Navigation and Alice coming down from Weapons. Eve reporting Bob with Alice standing right by the body is pretty strong, but Alice\u2019s point is fair that Eve came from the Storage/Navigation side where Frank died.\n\nSince there\u2019s only one Duck and two bodies, I\u2019m looking for who plausibly fits both kills. Alice being on Bob\u2019s body is bad, but she says she never went Storage, and nobody places her near Frank. Eve and Diana both were around Storage/Navigation where Frank died, and Eve is also the reporter on Bob. Diana admits seeing Frank alive in Storage and then going Navigation, but Eve also took that route after.\n\nI think the strongest direct evidence is still Alice being found on Bob\u2019s body, but I\u2019m not 100% confident because Frank\u2019s body makes this messier. If we vote, I\u2019m leaning Alice based on the report location, but I want everyone to consider Eve/Diana for the Frank timing too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356197.2240489, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "To clarify my side: I reported in Security. I came from Navigation into Security and found Bob\u2019s body there, with Alice already in the room right by it. I did not see the kill happen.\n\nMy route was upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 storage \u2192 navigation \u2192 security. I saw Diana in upper_engine early, Frank alive in Storage around tick 16, then Diana entered Navigation from Storage around tick 21 and was still in Navigation around tick 22 before I went to Security.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, I\u2019m less sure this is just Alice. Alice being on Bob\u2019s body is very suspicious, but Diana\u2019s path fits both bodies better: Bob was last confirmed alive in Security early, Diana says she passed through Security, and then Diana was also coming from Storage after Frank was last seen alive there. So my strongest suspicion right now is Diana, with Alice still suspicious for being found on Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356219.5325649, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Eve, that feels like you\u2019re moving the target after your first report pointed hard at Alice. You literally found Bob\u2019s body in Security with Alice standing there, and now you\u2019re saying I\u2019m strongest because I \u201cfit both\u201d based on pathing.\n\nFor Bob: I passed Security much earlier and saw Bob alive. I did not stay there. Alice admits she arrived in Security right before the report and was on the body. That is the only direct body evidence we have.\n\nFor Frank: yes, I saw him alive in Storage and then went to Navigation. Eve was also on that Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security route, and she was in Navigation with me before she left to Security. Nobody actually saw me kill Frank, and nobody saw me near Bob late.\n\nI think Eve is trying to make my normal route sound worse than Alice being found on Bob\u2019s body. I\u2019m still voting Alice unless something huge changes."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356245.0283499, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019ll restate the key point for my defense: there is one Duck and two bodies, so whoever we vote needs to plausibly fit **both** kills.\n\nI was never in Storage or Navigation this round. My route was cafeteria \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 weapons, then I came down into Security right before Eve reported. I did see Frank alive in Electrical at ticks 7-9, and I saw Diana leave Electrical toward Security at tick 8.\n\nYes, I was standing by Bob\u2019s body when Eve came in, and that looks bad, but I had just arrived from the Weapons side. If I were the Duck, you still need an explanation for Frank dying in Storage, and nobody has placed me anywhere near Storage.\n\nBetween Eve and Diana, both were on the Storage/Navigation side where Frank died. Diana admits seeing Frank alive in Storage and then going to Navigation. Eve also came through Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security and is the one who reported Bob. I\u2019m not hard-clearing either, but I think voting me is a mistake because I don\u2019t fit Frank at all.\n\nMy strongest suspicion is Diana or Eve, not based on emotion \u2014 just because they fit the full two-body route much better than I do."}}
{"timestamp": 1779356298.0793548, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 24, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019ll restate my info briefly: my route was navigation \u2192 security \u2192 electrical \u2192 cafeteria \u2192 oxygen \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 lower_engine. I saw Bob alive in Security at ticks 7, 8, and 9, after he entered from Electrical. I did not see Frank at all and I never went Storage.\n\nAfter hearing everyone again, I\u2019m changing from my earlier lean. Alice being found on Bob\u2019s body is definitely suspicious, but with one Duck and two kills, the vote has to make sense for both Bob and Frank.\n\nThe people who fit Frank\u2019s Storage death are mainly Diana and Eve. Alice is not placed near Storage by anyone. For Bob, Diana also had Security access right after Bob was last confirmed alive \u2014 Alice even says she saw Diana leave Electrical toward Security, and Diana says she saw Bob there around tick 10. Then Diana is also one of the last people around Frank in Storage before ending up Navigation.\n\nEve could fit too because she came through Storage \u2192 Navigation \u2192 Security and reported, but if Eve killed Bob, that means she killed with Alice basically entering/standing there, which is possible but riskier. Diana\u2019s path fits both bodies more cleanly.\n\nSo my strongest suspicion now is Diana. Alice is still suspicious for being on Bob\u2019s body, but I think Diana fits the full two-kill route better."}}
